{
  "_readme": [
    "Applied at build time to the harvested source names. harvested.json stays",
    "untouched and each product keeps `sourceName`, so image pairings and any",
    "re-harvest still resolve against the original title.",
    "",
    "Scope is deliberately limited to swapping named characters for descriptive",
    "equivalents. Disney, MGA and the rest do pursue decorators using their",
    "characters, and the swap costs nothing in search terms — people search",
    "'ice princess birthday decoration' as readily as the brand name.",
    "",
    "There is no general reword pass. Mechanically varying adjectives across a",
    "catalogue changes nothing for the customer and nothing legally."
  ],
